@startuml wf-app-consent-confirm
' Low-fidelity wireframe — SCR-APP-CONSENT-CONFIRM, the consent confirmation panel.
' PROPOSAL generated by AI. Every line of copy is a hypothesis for UX review (Q-02).
' It shows the consent as the bank granted it, not as the TPP asked for it (INV-CNS-05, R-CNS-05).
title SCR-APP-CONSENT-CONFIRM — consent confirmation panel (wireframe, proposal)

salt
{
  {* Bank app — enrolled device }
  {+
    <b>Confirm what Sandbox AISP Ltd may see
    .
    Account  | Current account ...8608   (Q-32)
    Access   | Balances, transactions
    .
    Account  | Savings ...8603           (Q-32)
    Access   | Balances
    .
    Until    | 31 March 2027             (as granted, R-CNS-05)
    How often| Up to 4 times a day
    .
    [ Confirm ] | [ Decline ]
    .
    "Confirming is your strong authentication for this request."
  }
}

legend bottom
  Open on this screen: Q-32 account labels, Q-33 whether a TPP brand is shown,
  Q-34 whether items may be deselected, Q-35 an account the PSU does not hold.
  UX-02 requires Decline to be as visible as Confirm; UX-04 requires the validity
  and frequency in plain language.
endlegend
@enduml
